OL,3,GNEWSAJury member at Noah Donohoe
OL,4,Ainquest is discharged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the jury at the Noah
OL,7,FDonohoe inquest has been discharged.
OL,9,FThe decision was announced on Monday by
OL,10,Fthe coroner Mr Justice Rooney.
OL,12,FThe reason has not been made public.
OL,14,FThe decision comes as the jury is due
OL,15,Fto resume deliberations in the case
OL,16,Fafter the summer recess.
